    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "複合材料製程　",
    "sub_ename": "COMPOSITE MATERIALS PROCESSING",
    "describe_ch": "本課程除了建立學生對複合材料基本的概念外，並對複合材料的各種加工方法與應用做一探討。完成此一課程同學將可了解複合材料的基本製造原理與方法及各種加工製程之特點。",
    "describe_eh": "The aims of this course are to establish the basic concepts of composite materials and to investigate the manufacturing process and applications of composite materials. When students complete this course, s/he should be able to understand the fundamental principle of manufacturing method and the feature of various composite process.",
